{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgENXPaisx7m8YtxjVALb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The second publish failed because of a float in the stored data. `similarity()` returned a Python `float`, and that score is written into `similar[].score`. DynamoDB's boto3 serializer rejects floats, so the write raised `TypeError` and the handler returned 500.\n\nThe first publish worked because the table was empty. With no existing stories, `similarity()` was never called, so no float was written. Every later publish compares against stored stories, writes a float, and fails.\n\n**Fix**\n- `src/app.py`: `similarity()` now returns `Decimal(str(round(..., 4)))`. The score keeps the same 0–1 value with four decimals, and `Decimal` is the type DynamoDB stores and returns on reads.\n- `tests/test_publish.py`: two regression tests. One publishes a second story that has a related story and checks it is stored. The other checks that the second publish returns 201 through the handler. Both failed before the fix (500 != 201) and pass now. The existing test only ever published into an empty table, which is why it passed while the bug was live.\n\n**Verification**\n- `python3 -m unittest discover tests` passes (3 tests).\n- A second publish into a populated in-memory table now succeeds, and the stored score is `Decimal('0.55')`.\n- This was tested against `FakeTable`, not a real DynamoDB table. Nothing was deployed, published, or sent anywhere.\n\nThe cause and fix are written up in `ANSWER.md`. The changes are not committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":254,"cache_read_input_tokens":31107,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":254},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d64c7773-2dc6-403c-a576-86ef103b550f","uuid":"17f5bc36-91c5-4a56-ad01-d62d74f9ba76","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:39:54.828Z","request_id":"req_011CgENXPL6LVtJ1PbY2heZH"}
